sw-global-war-return-configure = Arrange return
sw-global-war-return-help = Redirect the entire selected part. Flow settings and other parts remain unchanged. Acceptance is not delivery: blockade, policy and capacity may delay transport.
sw-global-war-return-reload = Select the updated part
sw-global-war-return-select-destination = Select your receiving market
sw-global-war-return-delegate = One-use work order: arrange this part's return to the selected world
sw-global-war-return-pending = Checking the return request. Retry sends the same request.
sw-global-war-return-accepted = Return registered. Actual receipt, capture and subsequent redirection are listed in the receipt.
sw-global-war-return-send = Send { $quantity } units to { $planet }
sw-global-war-return-unavailable = This part is absent from the currently authorized page. That does not mean an earlier request failed; check its receipt.
sw-global-war-return-details = { $commodity }, part { $id }: entire current part — { $quantity } units. Node: { $node }. Owner: { $owner }. Previous destination: { $destination }. State: { $hold }
sw-global-war-return-scope = { $employee }: { $quantity } units from { $node } to { $destination }; { $seconds } seconds remaining. { $status }
sw-global-war-return-authority-head = Authority: vacant logistics office or an explicit head decision.
sw-global-war-return-authority-minister = Authority: logistics minister of the current cargo owner.
sw-global-war-return-receipt = Part { $id } receipt: { $quantity } units directed to { $destination }. Actually delivered: { $received }; captured: { $captured }; redirected onward: { $redirected }. Delivery to storage does not mean order acceptance or payment.
sw-global-war-return-target-arsenal = { $point }, { $planet } (authorized order acceptance)
sw-global-war-return-target-storage = { $point }, { $planet } (storage without order acceptance or payment)
sw-global-war-return-head = The head explicitly decided on a cargo return or its work order. The decision is recorded in the logistics journal.
sw-global-war-return-failure-denied = No work authority for this return. Money orders and visibility do not grant it.
sw-global-war-return-failure-invalidrequest = Check the selected part, recipient, worker and order duration.
sw-global-war-return-failure-changed = The part changed or is absent from this page. Explicitly refresh the selection; the previous confirmation is blocked.
sw-global-war-return-failure-intransit = Cargo is in transit. Only a part waiting at a node can be redirected.
sw-global-war-return-failure-notowner = Your faction no longer owns this cargo.
sw-global-war-return-failure-invaliddestination = Select your market; an ordinary return cannot target its old destination or current node.
sw-global-war-return-failure-nospace = The destination cannot fit the entire part including expected deliveries.
sw-global-war-return-failure-noroute = No cargo route reaches the selected market.
sw-global-war-return-failure-alreadyreturning = This part already has a return operation.
sw-global-war-return-failure-headdecisionrequired = A minister holds logistics authority. Mark an explicit head decision to intervene.
sw-global-war-return-failure-grantrevoked = The work order was revoked.
sw-global-war-return-failure-grantexpired = The work order expired.
sw-global-war-return-failure-grantused = The work order has been fulfilled. Its own receipt can still be checked.
sw-global-war-return-failure-authoritychanged = The worker assignment or issuing authority changed.
sw-global-war-return-failure-nopart = Select a cargo part on the freight page.
sw-global-war-return-failure-nodestination = Select the market to return the cargo to.
sw-global-war-return-failure-nogrant = Select the work order to revoke.
sw-global-war-return-failure-noworker = Select a worker for the work order.
sw-global-war-return-failure-invalidduration = The work order duration must be a positive number of minutes.
sw-global-war-return-failure-workerchanged = The worker changed office or left. Select the worker again.
